# Keyboard help mode (Alt)

**No central shortcut panel.** Alt toggles **per-control KeyTips** (`WashShortcutBadge`, `WashActionKbd`, `ShortcutTarget`). Shortcuts run only while help is on (except Ctrl/Cmd+K). See developer doc **Keyboard help (Alt)** and `src/lib/component/own/local/keyboard/`.
